<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>500 Internal Server Error</title>
    <style>
        body { background-color: #f4f4f4; color: #333; font-family: sans-serif; text-align: center; padding: 150px; margin: 0; }
        h1 { font-size: 50px; margin: 0; }
        p { font-size: 20px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>500</h1>
    <p>An unexpected error occurred on the server.</p>
    <p>We are working to fix the problem. Please try again later.</p>
</body>
</html>
